      downstream: 'Forums, loader C2 panels, leak sites, stealer infrastructure, negotiation portals. Virtually every node requiring persistent online presence depends on this layer directly or indirectly.',
      priority: 'Foundation disruption. Upstream ISP depeering (McColo 2008 model) rather than individual site takedown produces multi-node disruption simultaneously. The Sophos VM template fingerprint (one image underlying 7,000+ ransomware-linked servers) is an underexploited proactive disruption vector.',
