      actors: 'Loader botnet operators (IcedID, Gootloader, Raspberry Robin), stealer vendors (Redline, Vidar, LummaC2), log market operators (Russian Market, 2easy), exploit brokers and vulnerability resellers.',
      downstream: 'IAB markets receive the primary access supply. RaaS operators and affiliates receive direct exploit-sourced access, bypassing the IAB layer entirely.',
      priority: 'High priority when combined with IAB market pressure. Loader distribution infrastructure (SEO poisoning networks, IoT C2 layers) takes months to rebuild and is the highest-durability target.',
      badges: ['Pipeline input','Footholds','Acquisition']
